New mage skill: transmute.

1) Transmute changes what a thing is made of.
   - It is what opens the tier ladder above soft stock.
   - It is the only bridge between a smith's materials and a tailor's.

2) An opal is the price, crushed at the start.
   - It is gone whether the working takes or not.
   - Every carat buys ten off the difficulty, which is what makes a hard
     change possible at all.

3) Distance is what costs.
   - The families run metal, crystal, rock, dead, generic, organic, hide,
     wood, magical, spiritual.
   - Every family crossed is ten more against you, plus what the target is
     worth on its own.
   - Working inside one family gives back half of what you started with,
     so mithril into starmetal is a short reach and cloth into starmetal
     is the length of the world.

4) Nothing changes until the end.
   - Every pulse is counted, and the change takes only if two thirds of
     them landed.

See HELP TRANSMUTE and HELP AUGMENTATION.
